# GitHub work-item board — scripts/work-items.mjs and the Claude Code SessionStart hook that reads it.
# Copy to `.env.github` and fill in. `pnpm items list` to check. Keep only one of `.env.github` and
# `.env.gitlab`: with both, `pnpm items` refuses to guess (BOARD_PROVIDER=github|gitlab settles it).
#
# WHY THIS IS NOT IN `.env`. mise.toml carries `[env] _.file = ".env"`, so everything in `.env` is exported
# into every shell opened in this repository and inherited by every process started from one — `pnpm dev`,
# the tests, anything. That is correct for the application's own configuration. These settings are not
# that: no application process reads them, and they lead to a key that writes to the issue tracker. mise
# does not load this file, and nothing but the board reader reads it. There is no fallback to `.env`.
#
# A GITHUB APP, NOT A PERSONAL TOKEN. The board tells our own comments from the reporter's by who wrote them.
# An App comments as `<slug>[bot]`, an account that is never a person; a developer's token would make that
# developer's replies read as the bot's follow-ups. Create the App, give it Issues, Pull requests and
# Contents (read and write) and Metadata (read), install it on this repository only, and download a private
# key. `docs/agents/issue-tracker.md` has the steps.
#
# THE PRIVATE KEY IS THE REAL SECRET. It can mint a token with any permission the App holds. Keep the PEM
# file outside the repository (`*.pem` is git-ignored here anyway, and the pre-commit hook refuses a key).
# Every process mints short-lived tokens from it per scope — board, assets, pull requests — and keeps them
# in memory only, so the token every session uses cannot open a pull request.
GITHUB_REPOSITORY=knowit/my-project
GITHUB_APP_ID=
# An absolute path, or one relative to this repository's root.
GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY_PATH=
# Optional; looked up from the repository when blank.
GITHUB_APP_INSTALLATION_ID=
# Optional; default https://api.github.com. Only GitHub Enterprise Cloud is supported.
GITHUB_API_URL=
# Optional; default 8000.
GITHUB_TIMEOUT_MS=
